WEBVTT

00:06:28.963 --> 00:06:35.063
And there is a quadrilateral
alliance summit in India

00:06:35.063 --> 00:06:39.397
between the US, India,
Australia and Japan

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.830
that is actually talking about partnering

00:06:41.863 --> 00:06:45.630
in this whole pandemic crisis

00:06:45.663 --> 00:06:49.597
in terms of both surveillance,
in terms of manufacturing,

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.663
in terms of vaccine deployment.

00:06:51.697 --> 00:06:55.163
So I think it's very interesting
what's happening in the world.

00:06:55.197 --> 00:06:58.430
And I think India
has finally found recognition

00:06:58.463 --> 00:07:01.097
as a major supplier of vaccines